{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# BossAI｜主流程图\nA–C 已实现；D–F 尚是计划。类与接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_BossAI.canvas|结构图]]、[[BossAI/结构|结构文档]]。选招 [[GGYGO_流程_Boss选招.canvas|子图]] · 换形态 [[GGYGO_流程_Boss换形态.canvas|目标子图]]。","x":0,"y":0,"width":1800,"height":155,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"spawn","type":"text","text":"1. BossEncounter 由 Definition 创建 BossState、BossCharacter 和 AIController。\n\n调用：BossEncounter::SpawnBoss → BossState::InitializeFromDefinition → 生成 Avatar/AIController；返回可用的三对象绑定。","x":0,"y":405,"width":410,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bind","type":"text","text":"2. BossState 持有 ASC/属性；PawnExtension 绑定当前 Avatar。\n\n调用：BossState::AttachAvatar(Pawn) → PawnExtension::InitializeAbilitySystem(ASC, BossState)；ASC/属性仍归 State。","x":490,"y":405,"width":410,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"brain","type":"text","text":"3. AIController 驱动 BT，选择 ActionTag；详见 [[GGYGO_流程_Boss选招.canvas|选招子图]]。\n\n调用：ChooseBossAction::ExecuteTask 读 Form/Phase/ActionSet，选中 ActionTag 写 Blackboard。","x":980,"y":405,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ga","type":"text","text":"4. BT 申请 GAS 能力；GA 执行 Montage、MeleeTrace、GE 与 Cue。\n\n调用：ActivateAbility::ExecuteTask → ASC::TryActivateAbility(Handle)；OnAbilityEnded 回填 BT 结果。","x":1480,"y":405,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"future","type":"text","text":"D–F 目标：目标/仇恨、阶段与形态切换事务。\n[[GGYGO_流程_Boss换形态.canvas|换形态目标子图]]\n\n计划接口尚未落地：Phase 转换锁、目标服务、换 Pawn 事务；此节点不是当前 C++ 调用链。","x":980,"y":972,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"persist","type":"text","text":"换形态时应保留 BossState 的属性、Buff、冷却和 AI 目标；当前完整事务未实现。\n\n目标不变量：DetachAvatar(OldPawn) / AttachAvatar(NewPawn) 不重建 ASC，Buff/冷却在 State 延续。","x":1480,"y":972,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"3"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"spawn","fromSide":"right","toNode":"bind","toSide":"left","label":"Owner / Avatar 装配"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"bind","fromSide":"right","toNode":"brain","toSide":"left","label":"战斗状态就绪"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"brain","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ga","toSide":"left","label":"ActionTag 申请"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"ga","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"future","toSide":"top","label":"后续阶段触发"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"future","fromSide":"right","toNode":"persist","toSide":"left","label":"目标保持状态连续"}
	]
}